<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>

  <!-- EN: handyman -->
  <OECivilian.degreeDatas.handyman.label>巧手工匠</OECivilian.degreeDatas.handyman.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} is a natural {PAWN_pronoun}. {PAWN_nameDef} is smart and work harder than others. -->
  <OECivilian.degreeDatas.handyman.description>{PAWN_nameDef}是天生的巧手。{PAWN_nameDef}聪明且比其他人更努力工作。</OECivilian.degreeDatas.handyman.description>

  <!-- EN: spiritual -->
  <OECultist.degreeDatas.spiritual.label>灵性</OECultist.degreeDatas.spiritual.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} has an unshakable will and body capable of withstanding any test. -->
  <OECultist.degreeDatas.spiritual.description>{PAWN_nameDef}拥有坚定不移的意志和能够承受任何考验的身体。</OECultist.degreeDatas.spiritual.description>

  <!-- EN: proudly -->
  <OEEidolon.degreeDatas.proudly.label>自豪</OEEidolon.degreeDatas.proudly.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} as a hero bathed in glory. -->
  <OEEidolon.degreeDatas.proudly.description>{PAWN_nameDef}是沐浴在荣耀中的英雄。</OEEidolon.degreeDatas.proudly.description>

  <!-- EN: nomad -->
  <OENomad.degreeDatas.nomad.label>游牧民</OENomad.degreeDatas.nomad.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_pronoun}'s are used to eating less food and getting enough sleep faster than others. -->
  <OENomad.degreeDatas.nomad.description>{PAWN_pronoun}习惯于比别人吃得更少，睡得更快满足。</OENomad.degreeDatas.nomad.description>

  <!-- EN: careful handler -->
  <OEQualityAnimals.degreeDatas.careful_handler.label>细心饲养员</OEQualityAnimals.degreeDatas.careful_handler.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} takes time to care for animals properly, often gathering more from each creature. -->
  <OEQualityAnimals.degreeDatas.careful_handler.description>{PAWN_nameDef}花时间妥善照料动物，通常能从每只动物身上获得更多资源。</OEQualityAnimals.degreeDatas.careful_handler.description>
  <!-- EN: efficient handler -->
  <OEQualityAnimals.degreeDatas.efficient_handler.label>高效饲养员</OEQualityAnimals.degreeDatas.efficient_handler.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} works quickly when gathering from animals, but may leave some resources behind. -->
  <OEQualityAnimals.degreeDatas.efficient_handler.description>{PAWN_nameDef}在从动物身上收集资源时工作迅速，但可能会留下一些资源。</OEQualityAnimals.degreeDatas.efficient_handler.description>

  <!-- EN: careful chef -->
  <OEQualityCooking.degreeDatas.careful_chef.label>细心厨师</OEQualityCooking.degreeDatas.careful_chef.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} values safety and quality in every meal, even if it takes a little longer. -->
  <OEQualityCooking.degreeDatas.careful_chef.description>{PAWN_nameDef}重视每餐的安全和质量，即使需要更长时间。</OEQualityCooking.degreeDatas.careful_chef.description>
  <!-- EN: blazing cook -->
  <OEQualityCooking.degreeDatas.blazing_cook.label>火爆厨师</OEQualityCooking.degreeDatas.blazing_cook.label>
  <!-- EN: Quick in the kitchen, {PAWN_nameDef} favors speed over caution. -->
  <OEQualityCooking.degreeDatas.blazing_cook.description>在厨房里动作迅速，{PAWN_nameDef}更喜欢速度而不是谨慎。</OEQualityCooking.degreeDatas.blazing_cook.description>

  <!-- EN: vein whisperer -->
  <OEQualityMining.degreeDatas.vein_whisperer.label>矿脉密语者</OEQualityMining.degreeDatas.vein_whisperer.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} extracts riches with uncanny precision, though never in a hurry. -->
  <OEQualityMining.degreeDatas.vein_whisperer.description>{PAWN_nameDef}以非凡的精确度提取财富，但从不匆忙。</OEQualityMining.degreeDatas.vein_whisperer.description>
  <!-- EN: tunnel dancer -->
  <OEQualityMining.degreeDatas.tunnel_dancer.label>隧道舞者</OEQualityMining.degreeDatas.tunnel_dancer.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} digs fast and fearlessly, but often leaves value behind. -->
  <OEQualityMining.degreeDatas.tunnel_dancer.description>{PAWN_nameDef}挖掘快速且无畏，但经常留下有价值的资源。</OEQualityMining.degreeDatas.tunnel_dancer.description>

  <!-- EN: gentle harvester -->
  <OEQualityPlants.degreeDatas.gentle_harvester.label>温柔收割者</OEQualityPlants.degreeDatas.gentle_harvester.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} nurtures every crop with care, but tends the fields at a measured pace. -->
  <OEQualityPlants.degreeDatas.gentle_harvester.description>{PAWN_nameDef}细心呵护每种作物，但以稳定的速度管理田地。</OEQualityPlants.degreeDatas.gentle_harvester.description>
  <!-- EN: swift planter -->
  <OEQualityPlants.degreeDatas.swift_planter.label>迅捷种植者</OEQualityPlants.degreeDatas.swift_planter.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} works the land with swift hands, though some harvests suffer. -->
  <OEQualityPlants.degreeDatas.swift_planter.description>{PAWN_nameDef}用灵巧的双手耕作土地，尽管有些收成会受到影响。</OEQualityPlants.degreeDatas.swift_planter.description>

  <!-- EN: golden soul -->
  <OESkillsMastery.degreeDatas.golden_soul.label>黄金灵魂</OESkillsMastery.degreeDatas.golden_soul.label>
  <!-- EN: There's something exceptional in {PAWN_nameDef} - a golden spark of talent in every endeavor. -->
  <OESkillsMastery.degreeDatas.golden_soul.description>{PAWN_nameDef}身上有某种非凡之处——在每项事业中都闪耀着天赋的金光。</OESkillsMastery.degreeDatas.golden_soul.description>
  <!-- EN: faded spark -->
  <OESkillsMastery.degreeDatas.faded_spark.label>黯淡火花</OESkillsMastery.degreeDatas.faded_spark.label>
  <!-- EN: Once full of promise, {PAWN_nameDef} now walks a dimmer path, struggling to meet expectations. -->
  <OESkillsMastery.degreeDatas.faded_spark.description>曾经充满希望的{PAWN_nameDef}现在走在黯淡的道路上，努力满足期望。</OESkillsMastery.degreeDatas.faded_spark.description>

  <!-- EN: trained -->
  <OESoldier.degreeDatas.trained.label>训练有素</OESoldier.degreeDatas.trained.label>
  <!-- EN: After many trainings, {PAWN_nameDef} learned how to use any weapon. -->
  <OESoldier.degreeDatas.trained.description>经过多次训练，{PAWN_nameDef}学会了如何使用任何武器。</OESoldier.degreeDatas.trained.description>

  <!-- EN: unstable catalyst -->
  <OEUnstableCatalyst.degreeDatas.unstable_catalyst.label>不稳定催化剂</OEUnstableCatalyst.degreeDatas.unstable_catalyst.label>
  <!-- EN: A volatile force stirs within {PAWN_nameDef}. When pushed to the edge, {PAWN_pronoun} may erupt with a surge of brilliance—or chaos.\n\nThere is a 75% chance that a mental break will trigger a random Inspiration. -->
  <OEUnstableCatalyst.degreeDatas.unstable_catalyst.description>一股不稳定的力在{PAWN_nameDef}内心涌动。当被推到极限时，{PAWN_pronoun}可能会爆发出辉煌——或混乱。\n\n精神崩溃有75%的几率触发随机灵感。</OEUnstableCatalyst.degreeDatas.unstable_catalyst.description>
  <!-- EN: Driven by unstable energy, [PAWN_nameIndef] unlocks untamed potential. -->
  <OEUnstableCatalyst.degreeDatas.unstable_catalyst.mentalBreakInspirationGainReasonText>受不稳定能量驱动，[PAWN_nameIndef]释放出未被驯服的潜力。</OEUnstableCatalyst.degreeDatas.unstable_catalyst.mentalBreakInspirationGainReasonText>

  <!-- EN: unstable charmer -->
  <OEUnstableCharmer.degreeDatas.unstable_charmer.label>不稳定魅力者</OEUnstableCharmer.degreeDatas.unstable_charmer.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef}'s erratic energy makes {PAWN_pronoun} strangely persuasive at the strangest times.\nThere is a 50% chance that a mental break will trigger a Inspired Recruitment. -->
  <OEUnstableCharmer.degreeDatas.unstable_charmer.description>{PAWN_nameDef}不稳定的能量使{PAWN_pronoun}在最奇怪的时候变得异常有说服力。\n精神崩溃有50%的几率触发灵感招募。</OEUnstableCharmer.degreeDatas.unstable_charmer.description>
  <!-- EN: With unstable conviction, [PAWN_nameIndef] gains the charm to sway others. -->
  <OEUnstableCharmer.degreeDatas.unstable_charmer.mentalBreakInspirationGainReasonText>凭借不稳定的信念，[PAWN_nameIndef]获得了影响他人的魅力。</OEUnstableCharmer.degreeDatas.unstable_charmer.mentalBreakInspirationGainReasonText>

  <!-- EN: unstable creator -->
  <OEUnstableCreator.degreeDatas.unstable_creator.label>不稳定创造者</OEUnstableCreator.degreeDatas.unstable_creator.label>
  <!-- EN: From the storm in {PAWN_pronoun} mind, bursts of artistic brilliance emerge.\nThere is a 50% chance that a mental break will trigger an Inspired Creativity. -->
  <OEUnstableCreator.degreeDatas.unstable_creator.description>从{PAWN_pronoun}内心的风暴中，迸发出艺术的辉煌。\n精神崩溃有50%的几率触发灵感创作。</OEUnstableCreator.degreeDatas.unstable_creator.description>
  <!-- EN: Inspired by inner chaos, [PAWN_nameIndef] becomes creatively unstoppable. -->
  <OEUnstableCreator.degreeDatas.unstable_creator.mentalBreakInspirationGainReasonText>受内心混乱启发，[PAWN_nameIndef]在创作上变得势不可挡。</OEUnstableCreator.degreeDatas.unstable_creator.mentalBreakInspirationGainReasonText>

  <!-- EN: unstable laborer -->
  <OEUnstableLaborer.degreeDatas.unstable_laborer.label>不稳定劳动者</OEUnstableLaborer.degreeDatas.unstable_laborer.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef} pushes {PAWN_pronoun}self to extremes, chasing fleeting sparks of productivity at great mental cost.\nThere is a 50% chance that a mental break will trigger a Work Frenzy. -->
  <OEUnstableLaborer.degreeDatas.unstable_laborer.description>{PAWN_nameDef}将{PAWN_pronoun}自己推向极限，以巨大的精神代价追逐短暂的生产力火花。\n精神崩溃有50%的几率触发工作狂热。</OEUnstableLaborer.degreeDatas.unstable_laborer.description>
  <!-- EN: Driven by inner chaos, [PAWN_nameIndef] enters a manic work frenzy. -->
  <OEUnstableLaborer.degreeDatas.unstable_laborer.mentalBreakInspirationGainReasonText>受内心混乱驱动，[PAWN_nameIndef]进入疯狂的工作狂热状态。</OEUnstableLaborer.degreeDatas.unstable_laborer.mentalBreakInspirationGainReasonText>

  <!-- EN: unstable marksman -->
  <OEUnstableMarksman.degreeDatas.unstable_marksman.label>不稳定神射手</OEUnstableMarksman.degreeDatas.unstable_marksman.label>
  <!-- EN: In moments of instability, {PAWN_nameDef}'s focus sharpens, turning chaos into deadly precision.\nThere is a 50% chance that a mental break will trigger a Shooting Frenzy. -->
  <OEUnstableMarksman.degreeDatas.unstable_marksman.description>在不稳定时刻，{PAWN_nameDef}的专注力增强，将混乱转化为致命的精确度。\n精神崩溃有50%的几率触发射击狂热。</OEUnstableMarksman.degreeDatas.unstable_marksman.description>
  <!-- EN: Riding the edge of madness, [PAWN_nameIndef] becomes unnervingly accurate with ranged weapons. -->
  <OEUnstableMarksman.degreeDatas.unstable_marksman.mentalBreakInspirationGainReasonText>在疯狂边缘游走，[PAWN_nameIndef]使用远程武器变得异常准确。</OEUnstableMarksman.degreeDatas.unstable_marksman.mentalBreakInspirationGainReasonText>

  <!-- EN: unstable surgeon -->
  <OEUnstableSurgeon.degreeDatas.unstable_surgeon.label>不稳定外科医生</OEUnstableSurgeon.degreeDatas.unstable_surgeon.label>
  <!-- EN: In a rare balance between madness and clarity, {PAWN_nameDef} performs medical miracles.\nThere is a 50% chance that a mental break will trigger a Inspired Surgery. -->
  <OEUnstableSurgeon.degreeDatas.unstable_surgeon.description>在疯狂与清醒之间罕见的平衡中，{PAWN_nameDef}创造医疗奇迹。\n精神崩溃有50%的几率触发灵感手术。</OEUnstableSurgeon.degreeDatas.unstable_surgeon.description>
  <!-- EN: Compelled by desperation, [PAWN_nameIndef] achieves surgical perfection. -->
  <OEUnstableSurgeon.degreeDatas.unstable_surgeon.mentalBreakInspirationGainReasonText>受绝望驱使，[PAWN_nameIndef]实现了外科手术的完美。</OEUnstableSurgeon.degreeDatas.unstable_surgeon.mentalBreakInspirationGainReasonText>

  <!-- EN: unstable trader -->
  <OEUnstableTrader.degreeDatas.unstable_trader.label>不稳定商人</OEUnstableTrader.degreeDatas.unstable_trader.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef}'s fractured mind occasionally strikes upon strokes of commercial genius.\nThere is a 50% chance that a mental break will trigger a Inspired Trade. -->
  <OEUnstableTrader.degreeDatas.unstable_trader.description>{PAWN_nameDef}破碎的心智偶尔会迸发出商业天才的火花。\n精神崩溃有50%的几率触发灵感贸易。</OEUnstableTrader.degreeDatas.unstable_trader.description>
  <!-- EN: Through the haze of instability, [PAWN_nameIndef] glimpses a moment of brilliant negotiation. -->
  <OEUnstableTrader.degreeDatas.unstable_trader.mentalBreakInspirationGainReasonText>透过不稳定的迷雾，[PAWN_nameIndef]瞥见了精彩谈判的一刻。</OEUnstableTrader.degreeDatas.unstable_trader.mentalBreakInspirationGainReasonText>

  <!-- EN: unstable wanderer -->
  <OEUnstableWanderer.degreeDatas.unstable_wanderer.label>不稳定流浪者</OEUnstableWanderer.degreeDatas.unstable_wanderer.label>
  <!-- EN: Restless and unpredictable, {PAWN_nameDef} finds moments of clarity in rapid, purposeless motion.\nThere is a 50% chance that a mental break will trigger a Go Frenzy. -->
  <OEUnstableWanderer.degreeDatas.unstable_wanderer.description>不安且不可预测的{PAWN_nameDef}在快速、无目的的运动中找到清晰的时刻。\n精神崩溃有50%的几率触发行走狂热。</OEUnstableWanderer.degreeDatas.unstable_wanderer.description>
  <!-- EN: Overwhelmed by turmoil, [PAWN_nameIndef] feels an irresistible urge to move. -->
  <OEUnstableWanderer.degreeDatas.unstable_wanderer.mentalBreakInspirationGainReasonText>被动荡压倒，[PAWN_nameIndef]感到无法抗拒的移动冲动。</OEUnstableWanderer.degreeDatas.unstable_wanderer.mentalBreakInspirationGainReasonText>

  <!-- EN: unstable whisperer -->
  <OEUnstableWhisperer.degreeDatas.unstable_whisperer.label>不稳定密语者</OEUnstableWhisperer.degreeDatas.unstable_whisperer.label>
  <!-- EN: {PAWN_nameDef}'s volatile aura oddly resonates with animals, if only for a moment.\nThere is a 50% chance that a mental break will trigger a Inspired Taming. -->
  <OEUnstableWhisperer.degreeDatas.unstable_whisperer.description>{PAWN_nameDef}易变的气场奇怪地与动物产生共鸣，即使只是片刻。\n精神崩溃有50%的几率触发灵感驯服。</OEUnstableWhisperer.degreeDatas.unstable_whisperer.description>
  <!-- EN: Driven by turmoil, [PAWN_nameIndef] momentarily connects deeply with nature's creatures. -->
  <OEUnstableWhisperer.degreeDatas.unstable_whisperer.mentalBreakInspirationGainReasonText>受动荡驱动，[PAWN_nameIndef]与自然生物建立了短暂而深刻的联系。</OEUnstableWhisperer.degreeDatas.unstable_whisperer.mentalBreakInspirationGainReasonText>

</LanguageData>
